{"seq":1,"slug":"interaction-foam","title":"交互与泡沫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/practice/interaction-foam","wordCount":1639,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"交互与泡沫\">交互与泡沫</h1><p>到目前为止，本 hub 的水都是&quot;自顾自地起伏&quot;——FFT 和 Gerstner 给的是统计意义上的开阔海面，玩家往里扔块石头，水面纹丝不动。但玩家会本能地期待水回应自己：船头划开一道尾迹、角色趟水溅起涟漪、爆炸在水面砸出一个坑。这就是交互。与交互紧密相伴的是泡沫——岸边拍碎的白沫、波峰翻卷的白头、船尾拖出的长长尾迹，它们都是&quot;水在剧烈运动&quot;的视觉证据。本篇讲这两件让水&quot;活过来&quot;的事：用动态高度场记录并扩散玩家扰动，以及泡沫的几类来源与生成判据（其中波峰泡沫直接来自 <a href=\"../waves/gerstner-waves\">Gerstner 波</a> 与 <a href=\"../waves/fft-ocean\">FFT 海洋谱</a> 的 Jacobian）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>动态高度场</strong>：用一张 ripple texture 记录玩家扰动（船、角色、落石&quot;盖章&quot;进去），每帧按离散波动方程扩散、衰减，成本只随纹理分辨率、与扰动数量无关。</li>\n<li><strong>渲染层假波</strong>：这张高度场水量不守恒、不绕障碍流动；真要做水流过地形、决堤倒水，得交给 <a href=\"../game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/interactive-water\">流体仿真</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>四类泡沫</strong>：岸边（水体厚度判据）、波峰（Gerstner/FFT 的 Jacobian 判据）、尾迹/交互（高度场扰动强度）、雨滴（天气驱动），分开处理才贴对位置。</li>\n<li><strong>产生快、消散慢</strong>：动态泡沫用一张单独的泡沫强度缓冲累积与淡出；飞溅的水滴/喷雾则跨入粒子的范畴，归 VFX 粒子系统。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"交互-一张会扩散的高度场\">交互：一张会扩散的高度场</h2><p>让水响应玩家，主流且便宜的做法不是去解流体方程，而是维护一张覆盖交互区域的动态高度场纹理（ripple texture）：玩家的扰动往里&quot;戳&quot;一个值，然后让这张纹理每帧按波动方程自行扩散、衰减。最常用的是基于上一帧和上上帧两张纹理的离散波动更新：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{t+1} = \\big(2 h_t - h_{t-1} + c^2 (\\nabla^2 h_t)\\big)\\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nabla^2 h_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9641em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用相邻纹素采样得到的拉普拉斯（衡量该点比四邻高还是低），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 控制波速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是阻尼让涟漪逐渐平息。整个更新是一个 ping-pong 的 Compute/像素 pass，成本只和纹理分辨率有关，与扰动数量无关。船、角色、落石把自己的位置&quot;盖章&quot;进高度场，剩下的扩散全交给这个 pass。这张交互高度场最后叠加到主波形（Gerstner/FFT）的位移与法线上，玩家就看到自己激起的、会传播会消退的涟漪。</p>\n<p>需要强调边界：这是渲染层面的&quot;假&quot;水波，水量不守恒、不绕障碍流动。真要做水流过地形、决堤、容器倒水这类物理，得用 <a href=\"../game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/interactive-water\">流体仿真</a> 的真正求解器。绝大多数游戏的交互水面，这张动态高度场已经足够可信且便宜得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泡沫的几类来源\">泡沫的几类来源</h2><p>泡沫不是一种东西，而是几种成因不同、触发条件也不同的白沫的统称。把它们分开处理，泡沫才会出现在&quot;对的地方&quot;而非满屏乱贴。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>泡沫类型</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>岸边泡沫</td>\n<td>水深趋近 0、靠近岸线</td>\n<td>深度缓冲（水体厚度小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波峰泡沫</td>\n<td>波形局部剧烈收缩/翻卷</td>\n<td>Gerstner/FFT 的 Jacobian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾迹/交互泡沫</td>\n<td>物体划过、剧烈扰动</td>\n<td>交互高度场的扰动强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雨滴泡沫</td>\n<td>降雨打在水面</td>\n<td>天气系统驱动的点状扰动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"岸边泡沫-复用深度\">岸边泡沫：复用深度</h2><p>岸边那圈随浪进退的白沫，判据极其现成——就是 <a href=\"../shading/fresnel-depth\">菲涅尔与深度色</a> 里已经算过的水体厚度。厚度小于某阈值（水很浅、接近岸线）就叠加泡沫纹理，并随主波形相位让泡沫边缘进退呼吸。配一张滚动的泡沫噪声贴图加柔和的过渡，就得到自然的拍岸白线。这一类几乎零额外成本，是性价比最高的泡沫，移动端也开得起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"波峰泡沫-jacobian-的归宿\">波峰泡沫：Jacobian 的归宿</h2><p>真实海浪在波峰快要翻卷时才泛白，因为那里水体被剧烈挤压、空气被卷入。怎么知道&quot;哪里在剧烈挤压&quot;？答案在波形章埋下的伏笔——Jacobian。它是位移场对原始坐标的雅可比行列式，衡量局部是被拉伸还是压缩；当它趋近零甚至为负，说明该处顶点正剧烈聚拢、波峰将翻卷，正是生成白沫的判据：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = (1 + \\partial_x \\xi_x)(1 + \\partial_z \\xi_z) - (\\partial_z \\xi_x)(\\partial_x \\xi_z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.046em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 是水平位移场。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J &lt; J_{threshold}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的像素叠加泡沫，并让泡沫量随&quot;负得多深&quot;增强，再加一点随时间的累积与消散（泡沫产生后不会立刻消失），就得到随大浪此起彼伏的、真实的波峰白头。FFT 海洋的 IFFT pass 可以顺带把 Jacobian 一并算进一张折叠图，几乎不额外花钱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[玩家扰动:船/角色/落石] --&gt; HF[动态高度场:波动方程扩散]&#10;  HF --&gt; RIPPLE[交互涟漪叠加主波形]&#10;  WAVE[主波形 Gerstner/FFT] --&gt; JAC[Jacobian]&#10;  JAC --&gt; CREST{J&lt;阈值?}&#10;  CREST --&gt;|是| CFOAM[波峰泡沫]&#10;  DEPTH[深度缓冲:水体厚度] --&gt; SHORE{厚度&lt;阈值?}&#10;  SHORE --&gt;|是| SFOAM[岸边泡沫]&#10;  HF --&gt; WFOAM[尾迹泡沫]&#10;  RIPPLE --&gt; OUT[活起来的水面]&#10;  CFOAM --&gt; OUT&#10;  SFOAM --&gt; OUT&#10;  WFOAM --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n  P[玩家扰动:船/角色/落石] --&gt; HF[动态高度场:波动方程扩散]\n  HF --&gt; RIPPLE[交互涟漪叠加主波形]\n  WAVE[主波形 Gerstner/FFT] --&gt; JAC[Jacobian]\n  JAC --&gt; CREST{J&lt;阈值?}\n  CREST --&gt;|是| CFOAM[波峰泡沫]\n  DEPTH[深度缓冲:水体厚度] --&gt; SHORE{厚度&lt;阈值?}\n  SHORE --&gt;|是| SFOAM[岸边泡沫]\n  HF --&gt; WFOAM[尾迹泡沫]\n  RIPPLE --&gt; OUT[活起来的水面]\n  CFOAM --&gt; OUT\n  SFOAM --&gt; OUT\n  WFOAM --&gt; OUT</pre><h2 id=\"尾迹与泡沫的衰减\">尾迹与泡沫的衰减</h2><p>船尾那条长长的白色尾迹，是交互高度场扰动强度的副产品：扰动剧烈处不仅压高度场，还往一张泡沫强度图里累积泡沫值，再让它随时间慢慢消散——于是船过之处留下一条逐渐淡去的白带。这种&quot;产生快、消散慢&quot;的累积逻辑对所有动态泡沫都适用，用一张单独的泡沫强度缓冲管理，与高度场并行更新。更复杂的喷溅水花、飞沫则跨入粒子的范畴，由 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/particle-system-architecture\">VFX 粒子系统</a> 处理：水面泡沫管&quot;贴在面上的白&quot;，粒子管&quot;离开水面飞起来的水滴&quot;，二者分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交互水用动态高度场记录玩家扰动并按波动方程扩散衰减，成本只随纹理分辨率、与扰动数无关，最后叠加到主波形。</li>\n<li>这是渲染层假波、水量不守恒；真物理交给 <a href=\"../game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/interactive-water\">流体仿真</a>。</li>\n<li>泡沫分岸边（深度判据）、波峰（Jacobian 判据）、尾迹/交互（高度场扰动）、雨滴（天气）四类，分开处理才贴对位置。</li>\n<li>波峰泡沫是 <a href=\"../waves/gerstner-waves\">Gerstner</a>/<a href=\"../waves/fft-ocean\">FFT</a> Jacobian 的归宿；飞溅水滴归 <a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/particle-system-architecture\">粒子系统</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"water-lod\">水体 LOD</a> —— 交互高度场与泡沫如何随距离裁剪、不在远景浪费。</li>\n<li>上游：<a href=\"../waves/gerstner-waves\">Gerstner 波</a> —— 波峰泡沫所依赖的 Jacobian 来源。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-fluid-simulation/realtime-water/interactive-water\">流体仿真 · 交互水</a> —— 需要真实水量守恒交互时的升级路线。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/particle-system-architecture\">VFX 粒子系统 · 架构</a> —— 飞溅水花用粒子实现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交互与泡沫","id":"交互与泡沫"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"交互：一张会扩散的高度场","id":"交互-一张会扩散的高度场"},{"level":2,"text":"泡沫的几类来源","id":"泡沫的几类来源"},{"level":2,"text":"岸边泡沫：复用深度","id":"岸边泡沫-复用深度"},{"level":2,"text":"波峰泡沫：Jacobian 的归宿","id":"波峰泡沫-jacobian-的归宿"},{"level":2,"text":"尾迹与泡沫的衰减","id":"尾迹与泡沫的衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"水下与焦散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/shading/underwater-caustics"},"next":{"title":"水体 LOD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/practice/water-lod"}}